  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、襟が曲がっちゃってたか。悪かったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。せっかくの素敵なスーツなのだから\r\nちゃんと着てあげたほうがいいだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ほら、アナタがより素敵になった",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや？\r\nその顔、私の言葉を疑うつもりかい？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんなつもりは……\r\n……そうか……そうだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は咲耶のプロデューサーなんだから、\r\nもっとキッチリしないとな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ふむ、そういう意味で言ったわけじゃないのだけれど……\r\n誤解をさせてしまったかな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス\r\n謙虚なところも、アナタの素晴らしい長所だけれどね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど……\r\n……ねぇ、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーは、今のままで\r\n十分素敵で……素晴らしい人だよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私こそ、もっとアナタに相応しいアイドルにならないと……\r\nと、思っているんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタの隣に立って、恥ずかしくないアイドルに",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、俺はそれほどのもんじゃ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "005"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、アナタがどう言おうと\r\n私の目標は決して揺るがないよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから、そのゴール地点で……\r\n待っててくれ、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……っと",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー\r\nもう出発しないと、入りに遅れてしまう時間だ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600711/2006007110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、もうこんな時間か！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007110210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、少し急ごうか\r\n遅刻なんて、アナタには似合わないからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
